OL,3,GNEWSAMurdered girl's father welcomes   
OL,4,Anew stalking law                       
OL,6,FThe founder of a charity set up after  
OL,7,Fhis daughter was murdered by an        
OL,8,Fex-boyfriend has reacted to a new      
OL,9,Fstandalone stalking offence being      
OL,10,Fcreated.                               
OL,12,FCurrently, the offences of stalking and
OL,13,Fharassment are different, with the onus
OL,14,Fon victims to prove that fear or       
OL,15,Fdistress has been caused. They will now
OL,16,Fbe streamlined into one offence.       
OL,18,FNick Gazzard, whose daughter Hollie    
OL,19,Fdied in 2014 after being stalked and   
OL,20,Fsubsequently killed by an ex-partner,  
OL,21,Ffounded the Gloucestershire-based      
OL,22,FHollie Gazzard Trust.                  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
