OL,3,GNEWSAMurdered girl's father welcomes   
OL,4,Anew stalking law                       
OL,6,F"We hope that with the focus on the    
OL,7,Foffender now, this will hopefully make 
OL,8,Fsure that victims are a lot safer and  
OL,9,Fhopefully encourage victims to come    
OL,10,Fforward to report it to the police," he
OL,11,Fsaid.                                  
